# the real laptop touchpad family (i2c-hid over LPSS + PCH GPIO irq). no table
# blob and no hardware models: ACPICA runs in the container over the kernel's
# real ACPI provider, and every register access is real. (satoru)
name i2chid
needs_msix_table_page 0
# the GpioInt line and the platform gpio mmio ranges come from ACPI. (satoru)
line_irq acpi
platform_mmio acpi
# end (satoru)
